                        ],
                        "form": "verkondigingen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "25b3fba9-1add-391b-90b9-adb0e707790c",
                        "entry_id": "7f3d2ccd-e028-3442-a221-591247fa8acb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het bekendmaken, het verkondigen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "98a17a8e-8294-4fdd-846c-2c6bbb4dcd4c",
                                "sense_id": "25b3fba9-1add-391b-90b9-adb0e707790c",
                                "text": "We lezen vandaag het evangelie van Mattheus, vers 7:21. „In het toegewijde leven ligt de toets, niet in de verkondiging.” Zo, met die woorden, zag ik de tekst tenminste ooit samengevat door een dominee. Iets letterlijker staat er dat je niet automatisch naar de hemel gaat door ‘Here, Here’ te zeggen. Je moet er ook wat voor doen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "580d7003-cf71-4d05-bd88-87e98cc9b4ce",
                                "sense_id": "25b3fba9-1add-391b-90b9-adb0e707790c",
                                "text": "Een curieus onderdeel van de productie van de 17de-eeuwse schilder Adriaen van de Velde wordt gevormd door religieuze voorstellingen. Hij staat immers vooral bekend om zijn betrekkelijk kleine Hollandse en Italianiserende landschappen, waarvan een ruime keuze nu wordt getoond in het Rijksmuseum. Een 128 cm hoog doek met de Bijbelse voorstelling van de Verkondiging aan Maria (1667) is daar dus, in afmetingen, thematiek, en ook stijl van schilderen, een vreemde eend in de bijt"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9a42f25e-0b25-40cf-bf6f-f2e2ac0de12c",
                        "source_entry_id": "7f3d2ccd-e028-3442-a221-591247fa8acb",
                        "source_sense_id": "25b3fba9-1add-391b-90b9-adb0e707790c",
                        "target_lang_word": "proclamation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "proclamation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6eca0026-8bad-378b-b46b-a17348f63912",
                                        "entry_id": "28f93401-7c06-3764-930d-3ed47ddbb661",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A statement which is proclaimed; formal public announcement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74591b81-1571-4660-8501-aecabde08b5e",
                                                "sense_id": "6eca0026-8bad-378b-b46b-a17348f63912",
                                                "text": "The Tuesday meetings are only thirty minutes now. That proclamation was made in the previous meeting."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a3e71a7-3fda-4a83-a787-7f29551568f1",
                        "source_entry_id": "7f3d2ccd-e028-3442-a221-591247fa8acb",
                        "source_sense_id": "25b3fba9-1add-391b-90b9-adb0e707790c",
                        "target_lang_word": "announcement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "announcement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "270cd55b-a471-3a9c-9ec5-c712222d05d2",
                                        "entry_id": "6b19a5ec-3949-37b6-a792-7bc57f21940b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of announcing, or giving notice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4db82f24-0394-4e90-af27-f15c15170461",
                                                "sense_id": "270cd55b-a471-3a9c-9ec5-c712222d05d2",
                                                "text": "He raised his hand to make his announcement and said, \"Excuse me everyone, I have an announcement to make.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc69f6df-c7ea-44ac-8eea-6ea76f41a500",
                                                "sense_id": "270cd55b-a471-3a9c-9ec5-c712222d05d2",
                                                "text": "Where else in the world can you pre-order sushi and fondue on some of the trains, travel in family carriages equipped with mini-playgrounds, or use a request stop button at some small stations? Where else can you hear the announcement: \"The train at Platform 4 is ten minutes late due to an incident in another country,\" as I did once at the Swiss station of Spiez?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb782c23-2cfc-320c-8507-74b7bdf55019",
                                        "entry_id": "6b19a5ec-3949-37b6-a792-7bc57f21940b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which conveys what is announced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fed345d-aad2-411c-8c5c-4e12133a1063",
                                                "sense_id": "fb782c23-2cfc-320c-8507-74b7bdf55019",
                                                "text": "This announcement was made during the first training session."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdfd8ebc-9aed-38a2-a8b1-e56754ae36e9",
                                        "entry_id": "6b19a5ec-3949-37b6-a792-7bc57f21940b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The content which is announced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd1c62a1-7956-43bf-bc25-3df056a43231",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfd8ebc-9aed-38a2-a8b1-e56754ae36e9",
                                                "text": "The announcement implied that somebody needed a spare Toshiba charger."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb4809c5-0752-4ef3-9987-68353469a3c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "7f3d2ccd-e028-3442-a221-591247fa8acb",
                        "source_sense_id": "25b3fba9-1add-391b-90b9-adb0e707790c",
                        "target_lang_word": "declaration",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
